                                                "sense_id": "61d4c330-cadb-3ef4-b8c3-dc809c2f5618",
                                                "text": "It blunted my appetite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f384ebc-e64e-400a-b7cb-bad247cc9370",
                                                "sense_id": "61d4c330-cadb-3ef4-b8c3-dc809c2f5618",
                                                "text": "My feeling towards her have been blunted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efda0d25-12e6-4a74-953f-9b2ff4135330",
                                                "sense_id": "61d4c330-cadb-3ef4-b8c3-dc809c2f5618",
                                                "text": "That settled the Merseysiders for a short while but it did not blunt the home side's spirit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d39859e-d9fa-48ab-b0e1-01e34c38eb85",
                                                "sense_id": "61d4c330-cadb-3ef4-b8c3-dc809c2f5618",
                                                "text": "I'm not saying that thousands of folk are not being inconvenienced, because they most certainly are, but the impact of strikes on government has been blunted."
